{"id":"5085cfd35249f6d3","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-craig-theorem.md","title":"Craig's Theorem","display":"thm-craig-theorem — Craig's Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-craig-theorem","aliases":["92-thm-craig-theorem"],"display":"thm-craig-theorem — Craig's Theorem","depends_on":["[[92-df-recursive-axiomatization]]","[[92-df-ce-set]]","[[92-df-axiomatization]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-craig-theorem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-craig-theorem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-craig-theorem — Craig's Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2f9850d6fe4ddc35\" href=\"?note=2f9850d6fe4ddc35\" title=\"92-df-recursive-axiomatization\">92-df-recursive-axiomatization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"69a2a133da01f9c9\" href=\"?note=69a2a133da01f9c9\" title=\"92-df-ce-set\">92-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a8fad09f2abacecd\" href=\"?note=a8fad09f2abacecd\" title=\"92-df-axiomatization\">92-df-axiomatization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (theory)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Code}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Code}_G\\)</span> (computable-enumerability predicate and code image)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Axiomatizes}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Axiomatizes}_G\\)</span> (axiomatization predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a8fad09f2abacecd\" href=\"?note=a8fad09f2abacecd\" title=\"92-df-axiomatization\">92-df-axiomatization</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)\\)</span> (recursive axiomatization predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2f9850d6fe4ddc35\" href=\"?note=2f9850d6fe4ddc35\" title=\"92-df-recursive-axiomatization\">92-df-recursive-axiomatization</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}craig\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\Bigl[\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Axiomatizes}_G(A,T)\\land\\mathrm{CE}(\\mathrm{Code}_G(A))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}craig\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\Bigl[\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Axiomatizes}_G(A,T)\\land\\mathrm{CE}(\\mathrm{Code}_G(A))\\bigr)\\Bigr]\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Craig技巧：若一个理论有CE公理化，则它也有产生同一理论闭包的递归公理化；断言现已展开，不再依赖未定义的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CEAx}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{CEAx}_G\\)</span></li>\n<li>若公理集是CE集</li>\n<li>则存在等价的递归公理集</li>\n<li>技巧：用&quot;冗余&quot;公理替换</li>\n<li>每个CE理论都可递归公理化</li>\n<li>证明理论的重要工具</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-recursive-axiomatization","status":"resolved","id":"2f9850d6fe4ddc35","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-axiomatization]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-axiomatization","status":"resolved","id":"a8fad09f2abacecd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-axiomatization]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-axiomatization","status":"resolved","id":"a8fad09f2abacecd","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Axiomatizes}_G$ (axiomatization predicate, see [[92-df-axiomatization]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-axiomatization","status":"resolved","id":"2f9850d6fe4ddc35","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)$ (recursive axiomatization predicate, see [[92-df-recursive-axiomatization]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Code}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Axiomatizes}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}craig\\text{-}theorem}\\vdash\n\\Bigl[\\exists A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\\bi